          "detail": "DEMO_STARTUP_FAIL=true is a drill fault. If merged, the new Pod exits with startup_failed and CrashLoopBackOff; the old Pod staying Ready only demonstrates maxUnavailable:0/maxSurge:1 protection, not a successful release. Reject the value and require the normal setting.",
