          "title": "No traffic signal for health claims"
        },
        {
          "detail": "Recovering local env patches or running argocd app rollback / kubectl rollout undo does not constitute a GitOps rollback; a revert commit plus Argo sync and rollout/version verification is required.",
          "severity": "REVIEW",
          "title": "Rollback must change Git desired state"
        }
